  "findings": [
    "The unchanged baseline reproduced successful web extraction followed by refusal because no write/rendering tools were exposed in every website trial.",
    "The candidate created a website PDF in 4/4 trials and a local PDF in 2/2 trials; the baseline created neither (0/4 and 0/2).",
    "CSV and read-only controls passed in both variants. CSV median latency fell from 25.129s to 15.506s and dispatches fell from six to four.",
    "The candidate costs additional schema context: the website initial schema estimate rose from 1121 to 3279 tokens; read-only input tokens rose from a mean of 2471 to 3627.5.",
    "Primary combined artifact/runtime success improved from 4/8 to 7/8. One candidate website trial exhausted its four-minute budget after creating the PDF.",
    "Under the extended budget both candidate PDFs were created and delivered, but one runtime retained partially_completed after an earlier command timeout. The other completed_with_recovered_errors. Both baselines still lacked write tools.",
    "These results establish removal of the observed capability-visibility blocker. They do not establish universally reliable document completeness, recovery classification, or deadline handling."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Small targeted sample, one model, Standard routing only; not a Terminal-Bench score or statistical reliability estimate. JEV behavior is covered by deterministic negative/uncertain/stale-response regression tests, not a live JEV comparison.",
    "Preliminary Docker-execution-mode trials were confounded by host-tool admission restrictions; their complete 16-trial calibration results are retained locally but excluded from primary scoring. CSV wording was clarified before primary trials to require a file.",
    "The extended phase was added after observing the primary deadline stop. Original primary failures remain in the report; no successful retry replaces them.",
    "Container emulation and concurrent regression work can affect wall-clock measurements. Latencies are observations, not portable speed guarantees.",
    "Two PDFs did not match every block in the stricter content audit. Artifact production alone must not be presented as complete content fidelity.",
    "Native Telegram delivery, Chrome startup, Docker host-tool admission, completion classification after command errors, and output-quality guarantees are outside this patch."
